# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:The Red Reef/Journal" by tools/quests/journals_from_wiki.py; set a step's stage to pin it.
step	1	-	Getting started
line	<col=000080>I can start this quest by talking to <col=800000>Raley</col> at his home on the <col=800000>Great Conch</col>.</col>
step	2	-	Asking around
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Raley</col> at his home on the <col=800000>Great Conch</col>. He mentioned <col=800000>Floopa</col> had gone missing, so I offered to help find her. I should ask around town and see if anyone has seen her.</col>
step	3	-	Sacred Grove
line	<str>I spoke to Raley at his home on the Great Conch. He mentioned Floopa had gone missing, so I offered to help find her.</str>
line	<col=000080>I asked around town and apparently <col=800000>Floopa</col> was heading towards the <col=800000>Sacred Grove</col> in the middle of the island. I should look for her there.</col>
step	4	-	Sailing to Red Rock
line	<str>I spoke to Raley at his home on the Great Conch. He mentioned Floopa had gone missing, so I offered to help find her.</str>
line	<str>I asked around town and was told that Floopa was seen heading towards the Sacred Grove. I went there and spoke to Elder Katt. She confirmed Floopa was inside and gave me permission to go in and speak with her.</str>
line	<col=000080>I found and spoke with <col=800000>Floopa</col> in the <col=800000>Sacred Grove</col>. She told me she needed to make a new spear to deal with a threat to her people, but was struggling to do so due to her injury.</col>
line	<col=000080>Upon further questioning, she revealed that she used to work for the <col=800000>Red Reef Trading Company</col>, owned by <col=800000>Spencer Brentwood</col>. However, they betrayed her, leading to her injury.</col>
line	<col=000080>She shared with me her suspicions that they might have been involved in the attack on the <col=800000>Little Pearl</col>. I offered to investigate the <col=800000>Company</col> to find out more, giving her more time to heal. She directed me to sail to <col=800000>Red Rock</col>, an island west of the <col=800000>Great Conch</col>, where the <col=800000>Company</col> is based.</col>
step	5	-	Investigating the Company
line	<str>I spoke to Raley at his home on the Great Conch. He mentioned Floopa had gone missing, so I offered to help find her.</str>
line	<str>I asked around town and was told that Floopa was seen heading towards the Sacred Grove. I went there and spoke to Elder Katt. She confirmed Floopa was inside and gave me permission to go in and speak with her.</str>
line	<str>I found and spoke with Floopa in the Sacred Grove. She told me she needed to make a new spear to deal with a threat to her people, but was struggling to do so due to her injury.</str>
line	<str>Upon further questioning, she revealed that she used to work for the Red Reef Trading Company, owned by Spencer Brentwood. However, they betrayed her, leading to her injury.</str>
line	<str>She shared with me her suspicions that they might have been involved in the attack on the Little Pearl. I offered to investigate the Company to find out more, giving her more time to heal.</str>
line	<col=000080>To begin my investigation, <col=800000>Floopa</col> directed me to sail to <col=800000>Red Rock</col>, an island west of the <col=800000>Great Conch</col>, where the <col=800000>Red Reef Trading Company</col> is based.</col>
step	6	-	Inspecting the Display Cases
line	<str>I spoke to Raley at his home on the Great Conch. He mentioned Floopa had gone missing, so I offered to help find her.</str>
line	<str>I asked around town and was told that Floopa was seen heading towards the Sacred Grove. I went there and spoke to Elder Katt. She confirmed Floopa was inside and gave me permission to go in and speak with her.</str>
line	<str>I found and spoke with Floopa in the Sacred Grove. She told me she needed to make a new spear to deal with a threat to her people, but was struggling to do so due to her injury.</str>
line	<str>Upon further questioning, she revealed that she used to work for the Red Reef Trading Company, owned by Spencer Brentwood. However, they betrayed her, leading to her injury.</str>
line	<str>She shared with me her suspicions that they might have been involved in the attack on the Little Pearl. I offered to investigate the Company to find out more, giving her more time to heal.</str>
line	<col=000080>To begin my investigation, <col=800000>Floopa</col> directed me to sail to <col=800000>Red Rock</col>, an island west of the <col=800000>Great Conch</col>, where the <col=800000>Red Reef Trading Company</col> is based. Once there, I spoke with a <col=800000>Receptionist</col> and offered my services to the <col=800000>Company</col>. She arranged a meeting for me with her superior, <col=800000>Theodore Paxton</col>. While I wait, she suggested I inspect the <col=800000>Display Cases</col> around her to learn more about the <col=800000>Company</col>.</col>
