step	15	-	Diving with Spencer
line	<str>I spoke to Raley at his home on the Great Conch. He mentioned Floopa had gone missing, so I offered to help find her.</str>
line	<str>I asked around town and was told that Floopa was seen heading towards the Sacred Grove. I went there and spoke to Elder Katt. She confirmed Floopa was inside and gave me permission to go in and speak with her.</str>
line	<str>I found and spoke with Floopa in the Sacred Grove. She told me she needed to make a new spear to deal with a threat to her people, but was struggling to do so due to her injury.</str>
line	<str>Upon further questioning, she revealed that she used to work for the Red Reef Trading Company, owned by Spencer Brentwood. However, they betrayed her, leading to her injury.</str>
line	<str>She shared with me her suspicions that they might have been involved in the attack on the Little Pearl. I offered to investigate the Company to find out more, giving her more time to heal.</str>
line	<str>To begin my investigation, Floopa directed me to sail to Red Rock, an island west of the Great Conch, where the Red Reef Trading Company is based. Once there, I spoke with a Receptionist and offered my services to the Company. She arranged a meeting for me with her superior, Theodore Paxton.</str>
line	<str>I spoke with Theodore Paxton and he asked me to deal with Black Eye Bethel, a pirate causing trouble for the Company. I sailed to her hideout at Last Light, south of Red Rock. Once there, I defeated Bethel and her crew.</str>
line	<str>I returned to Theodore Paxton at Red Rock. He was impressed with my work and suggested I might be able to help his boss, Spencer Brentwood, with an issue.</str>
line	<str>I sailed out to the Zenith, Spencer Brentwood's ship, in the middle of the Red Reef. Once on board, I spoke with Spencer and he asked me to join him on a dive.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Spencer</col> and I dived down to the seabed. Once there, he showed me some <col=800000>Red Coral</col>, a valuable substance that the <col=800000>Red Reef Trading Company</col> gathers and sells. He then asked me to help him repair some of the <col=800000>Coral Dredgers</col> used to gather the <col=800000>Red Coral</col>. I need to fix the northern <col=800000>Dredger</col> while <col=800000>Spencer</col> sorts out the eastern one.</col>
