line	<col=000080>I helped <col=800000>Spencer</col> fix some damaged <col=800000>Coral Dredgers</col> and we returned to the <col=800000>Zenith</col>. Once we were back on board, <col=800000>Spencer</col> revealed that he can no longer gather enough <col=800000>Red Coral</col> to >meet demand and that he needs a new source. He told me that he plans for a reef in the <col=800000>Pearl Bank</col> to be this source, but that he first needs the <col=800000>Tortugans</col> to leave the <col=800000>Little Pearl</col>. With his previous attempts having failed, he tasked me with coming up with a new plan for getting them to leave. I should return to <col=800000>Floopa</col> and <col=800000>Raley</col> on the <col=800000>Great Conch</col> and tell them what I've learnt.</col>
