done	<str> I spoke with Theodore Paxton and he asked me to deal with Black Eye Bethel, a pirate causing trouble for the Company. I sailed to her hideout at Last Light, south of Red Rock. Once there, I defeated Bethel and her crew.</str>
done	<str> I returned to Theodore Paxton at Red Rock. He was impressed with my work and suggested I might be able to help his boss, Spencer Brentwood, with an issue.</str>
done	<str> I sailed out to the Zenith, Spencer Brentwood's ship, in the middle of the Red Reef. Once on board, I spoke with Spencer and he asked me to join him on a dive.</str>
done	<str> Spencer and I dived down the seabed. Once there, he showed me some Red Coral, a valuable substance that the Red Reef Trading Company gathers and sells.</str>
done	<str> I helped Spencer fix some damaged Coral Dredgers and we returned to the Zenith. Once we were back on board, Spencer revealed that he could no longer gather enough Red Coral to meet demand and that he needed a new source. He told me of a plan for a reef in the Pearl Bank to be his source, but that he couldn't begin work there due to the Tortugans on the Little Pearl. With his previous attempts having failed, he tasked me with coming up with a new plan for getting them to leave the island. I returned to Floopa and Raley on the Great Conch and told them what I'd learnt and they started forming a plan for dealing with Spencer.</str>
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
